- Run terminal commands ONE at a time. Never chain commands with && or ||.
- Never use redirection (>, >>, 2>&1) or pipes (|).
- Run cd as its own command before other commands.
- NEVER run git commit or git push. Report completed work; the human commits.
- NEVER modify files via shell commands (python -c, sed, awk, echo redirects). Always use the file editing tools (replace_in_file / write_to_file).
